{
 "id": "600b6202-2d5e-42d5-9d34-8eba99670279",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Mastermind, I'll Do Anything For You But Marriage!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "흑막님, 결혼 빼고 다 해드릴게요!"
   },
   {
    "en": "Mastermind, I'll Do Anything But Marriage!"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "I have possessed the body of “Enrica Wintersoar,” a character who is murdered by her villainous husband, the Grand Duke, on the first night of their marriage.\n\nThe only way to avoid that awful death is to break off the marriage with the Grand Duke.\n\n“There is a way, Enri.”\n\nA man strides into Enrica’s life when she has no place to retreat to. He introduces himself as “Count Kael Belbrington.” \n\nAlthough I agonized for a short while over whether such a character existed in the original work…\n\n“Wouldn’t it be fine… to marry a man who isn’t your fiance?” \n\nThe clever scheme he came up with isn’t bad! However, where will I find a man to marry this instant?\n\n\"My lord, will you marry me?\"\n\nWith nothing else to lose, I proposed to the man standing before me…\n\n“Yes. I was waiting for those words.”\n\nCan things really be resolved this easily?"
  },
